window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>We all have secrets we would die to protect and truths we would kill to uncover.</p> <p></p> <p>My search for answers leads me to an abandoned church and the dwelling of three psychotic, masked men.</p> <p></p> <p>These three Beasts are the stuff of nightmares, leaving no witnesses to the horror they sow.</p> <p></p> <p>They are ruthless and deranged, but they are the ones who hold the answers to my past and the key to unlock my future.</p>"; 
